<p>Welcome to Sessy!</p>
<% if @source %>
  <p>Your account is ready, and we've created a source called <strong><%= @source.name %></strong> for you. Here's how to connect it to SES — it takes a few minutes and you don't share any AWS credentials with us:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><%= link_to "Open the Setup page", @setup_url %> and pick the AWS region you send email from. (If you're signed out, enter the one-time code we email you and you'll land right back there.)</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Launch Stack</strong>. It opens a pre-filled CloudFormation form in your AWS console that creates the configuration set, SNS topic, and event destination for you.</li>
    <li>Send email through that configuration set — deliveries, bounces, complaints, opens, and clicks show up in Sessy moments later.</li>
  </ol>
<% else %>
  <p>Your account is ready. Here's how to start watching your SES activity:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><%= link_to "Sign in", @setup_url %> with this email address — we'll send you a one-time code.</li>
    <li>Create a source for each SES configuration set you want to track, then pick your AWS region and click <strong>Launch Stack</strong> on its Setup page. CloudFormation creates the configuration set, SNS topic, and event destination for you.</li>
    <li>Send email through that configuration set — deliveries, bounces, complaints, opens, and clicks show up in Sessy moments later.</li>
  </ol>
<% end %>
<p style="color: #71717a; font-size: 14px;">Stuck or have questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
